==============================================================================
O76/26 - 餘下開放問題攻堅
==============================================================================

==============================================================================
A. alpha = 0 第一性原理 (光度距離對偶)
==============================================================================

  通量鏈 (靜態宇宙, 冇膨脹 -> 冇光子數稀釋):
    F = L/(4*pi*D_A^2) * (1+z)^-1        <- 每個光子能量損失 (W-field)
                        * (1+z)^-b       <- 到達率被時間膨脹 (b = 時間膨脹指數)
    D_L 定義: F = L/(4*pi*D_L^2)
    => D_L = D_A * (1+z)^((1+b)/2)
    => 對偶指數 alpha = (b-1)/2

  三個情形:
    b = 0 (經典 tired light, 冇時間膨脹): D_L/D_A = (1+z)^0.5   (alpha = -0.5)
    b = 1 (IDCM 機制 B: 所有週期過程跟能量標尺): D_L/D_A = (1+z) (alpha = 0)  <- 零參數
    LambdaCDM (膨脹): D_L/D_A = (1+z)^2

  ★ 關鍵: IDCM 嘅 b 唔係自由參數 —— z 同時間膨脹由**同一個 W-field 能量損失**產生:
    光子能量 E(s) = E0 e^{-a s}, 1+z = e^{a s}; 週期過程時間標尺 tau ∝ 1/E
    => Delta_t_obs = Delta_t_emit * (1+z)^1  EXACT  =>  b = 1 EXACT  =>  alpha = 0 EXACT

  [OK] A1  alpha = (b-1)/2 恆等式 (b=0 -> -0.5)   computed=-0.5
  [OK] A2  b = 1 -> alpha = 0 EXACT (IDCM)   computed=0

  DES time dilation (Gupta 2026 引述): b = 1.003 +/- 0.011
  => alpha_DES = (b-1)/2 = +0.0015 +/- 0.0055
  => 同 alpha = 0 偏離 0.27 sigma
  [OK] A3  DES time dilation 同 alpha = 0 一致 (<2 sigma)   computed=0.27 sigma

  Pantheon+ 偏好: alpha_SN = +0.0392 +/- 0.0140  =>  b_SN = 1.0784 +/- 0.0280
  => b_SN vs b_DES 張力 = 2.51 sigma
  [OK] A4  ★發現: SNe 偏好嘅 b 同 DES time dilation 有 ~2.7 sigma 張力 (記為 🟡)   computed=2.51 sigma
  [OK] A5  alpha = 0 由結構強制 (唔係 fit)   computed=b = 1 EXACT

==============================================================================
B. CMB T(z) — IDCM 推導 + 公開量度對照
==============================================================================

  IDCM 推導:
    光子能量損失: E_obs = E_emit/(1+z)  (W-field)
    CMB 黑體溫度 ∝ 光子特徵能量 (T = <E>/2.701 k_B)
    => T(z) = T0 (1+z)^1  EXACT  =>  beta = 0 EXACT
    (同 LambdaCDM 預言一樣, 但機制唔同: IDCM = 傳播能量損失, LCDM = 膨脹降溫)

  T0 (Fixsen 2009) = 2.72548 +/- 0.00057 K
  來源                       z    T_obs    err   T_IDCM   sigma
  Muller 2013         0.8900    5.079  0.099    5.151   -0.72
  Noterdaeme 2011     1.7293    7.500  1.400    7.439   +0.04
  Noterdaeme 2011     1.7738    7.800  0.650    7.560   +0.37
  Noterdaeme 2011     2.0377    8.600  1.050    8.279   +0.31
  Srianand 2008       2.4184    9.150  0.720    9.317   -0.23
  Noterdaeme 2010     2.6896   10.500  0.700   10.056   +0.63
  Molaro 2002         3.0250   12.100  2.450   10.970   +0.46
  Riechers 2022       6.3400   23.100  6.900   20.005   +0.45

  IDCM (beta = 0) chi2 = 1.63 / 8 dof  = 0.203
  [OK] B1  IDCM beta=0 chi2/dof < 2   computed=0.203
  自由擬合 beta = +0.0015  (chi2 = 1.62)
  vs IDCM beta = 0: delta chi2 = +0.00
  [OK] B2  自由擬合 beta 同 0 一致 (delta chi2 < 9 = 3 sigma)   computed=dchi2 = +0.00
  文獻 Noterdaeme 2011        beta = -0.0070 +/- 0.0270  ->  beta=0 偏離 0.26 sigma
  文獻 Muller 2013            beta = +0.0090 +/- 0.0190  ->  beta=0 偏離 0.47 sigma
  文獻 Luzzi 2015 (tSZ)       beta = +0.0090 +/- 0.0170  ->  beta=0 偏離 0.53 sigma
  文獻 Luzzi 2015 combined    beta = +0.0060 +/- 0.0130  ->  beta=0 偏離 0.46 sigma
  文獻 Avgoustidis 2016       beta = +0.0076 +/- 0.0080  ->  beta=0 偏離 0.95 sigma
  [OK] B3  全部文獻組合值同 beta = 0 一致 (<1 sigma)   computed=5/5 < 1 sigma

